Subject: [PATCH] pike: add runtime-configurable parameters and cleanup

- Introduced pike_config module for runtime configuration adjustments
  (e.g., sampling_time_unit and remove_latency).
- Updated timers and internal logic to use cfg framework values.
- Added runtime-updatable max hits and related helper functions.
- Refactored outdated parameter handling for better modularity.
- Enhanced documentation with relevant configuration details.
---
